**What it does:** with `TF_DS_CACHE_REPLACE_STALE=1`, `keepWith`'s duplicate arm drops a kept state the family let go (stale rows / dropped snap / loading / planner-held, `e.point == null`) and saves the fresh copy instead of refreshing a dead entry. Off path is byte-identical. Decode path untouched — cache policy only.

