**Independent review:** verdict *approve*; its minor/nit findings (inert arm without tier/exact/endstate — the brief-scoped-out "usable half"; sticky `shared`/`group` not carried on replace; refuse-after-replace keeps nothing; the `lanes_main` identical-resend end-keep corner) are all recorded and reflected in `report-0276.md`.

